!Beaucedine Glacier (S)- Regal Pawprints.png|right|
* Examine the **Regal Pawprints** (H-9) {z:Beaucedine Glacier (S)} for a cutscene. The target is behind the tree near the bottom of the ramp from the Campaign Arbiter.
* Examining the **Regal Pawprints** a second time will spawn five NM's: {m:Count Halphas} and 4 {m:Dark Demons|Dark Demon}.
** Only {m:Count Halphas} needs to be defeated to continue. Once he is dead the {m:Dark Demons|Dark Demon} will vanish.
** The {m:Dark Demons|Dark Demon} can be slept with {p:sleepga|Sleepga}, however {m:Count Halphas} is immune to {s:sleep|Sleep}.
* Once defeated, examine the **Regal Pawprints** again for a cutscene.

